            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h5>Budget Planner</h5>
                    <p>Set monthly budgets per category. Get alerts before you overspend.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
                    <h5>AI Advisor</h5>
                    <p>Get personalized spending advice powered by AI based on your habits.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
